      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "1 Bedroom Apartment\r\n\r\nDesigned with modern living in mind, the one-bedroom apartments at Lightburne offer a stylish and highly efficient home in one of Dublin 18's most connected locations. Thoughtfully laid out to maximise space and natural light, these contemporary apartments provide comfortable open-plan living with a seamless flow between the kitchen, dining and living areas. Many homes also benefit from a private balcony or terrace, creating an ideal extension of the living space.\r\n\r\nThe spacious bedroom includes generous storage, while the bathroom is finished to a high contemporary standard with quality fittings and finishes throughout. Energy-efficient construction and A-rated performance ensure year-round comfort and lower running costs.\r\n\r\nLocated adjacent to the Glencairn Luas Stop, Lightburne places residents within easy reach of Sandyford, Dundrum and Dublin City Centre. Surrounded by excellent amenities, employment hubs, green spaces and local services, it offers the perfect balance of connectivity, convenience and modern apartment living.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n\r\nContemporary open-plan living and dining space\r\nPrivate balcony or terrace\r\nHigh-quality kitchen and bathroom finishes\r\nA-rated, energy-efficient home\r\nSecure underground parking available\r\nAdjacent to Glencairn Luas Stop\r\n\r\nThis is a home designed to fit modern lifestyles, combining thoughtful design, excellent connectivity and the opportunity to own in a vibrant new Dublin 18 community."
      },
